<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - NYS Environ. Fac. Corp., $62 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - NYS Environ. Fac. Corp., $62 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>New York State</p>
<p>RE: $62,350,000*</p>
<p>Environmental Facilities Corporation</p>
<p>Riverbank State Park Special Obligation</p>
<p>Refunding Revenue Bonds, 1996 Series</p>
<p>Received the written</p>
<p>award.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for January 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Please note the change in structure to include serial bonds in 2007 and 2008. These bonds will be sold on a net designated basis.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
